§§ `The applicant`

`governor Anna` MEANS Governor WITH
    name IS "Anna"
    `is a natural person` IS TRUE
    `is resident in Jersey` IS TRUE
    `is itself a Jersey entity by virtue of Article 2(3)(a)` IS FALSE
    `reportable matters` IS EMPTY

`governor Ben` MEANS Governor WITH
    name IS "Ben"
    `is a natural person` IS TRUE
    `is resident in Jersey` IS FALSE
    `is itself a Jersey entity by virtue of Article 2(3)(a)` IS FALSE
    `reportable matters` IS EMPTY

-- The kinds are those of Article 2(1); `is a Jersey entity` is G1's output (Article 2(3)) and is supplied here as a fact.
`a Jersey company that has applied` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Hope Foundation Limited"
    `standing on the register` IS `an applicant for registration`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `a company`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
    governors IS LIST `governor Anna`, `governor Ben`
    purposes IS EMPTY

`a Jersey company that is a registered charity` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Hope Foundation Limited"
    `standing on the register` IS `entered in the general section`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `a company`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
    governors IS LIST `governor Anna`, `governor Ben`
    purposes IS EMPTY

-- Article 2(1)(ba), from 16 October 2025: a Jersey NPO body corporate that is in none of (c) to (h); Article 2(3)(a) reaches it by letter order (G1's fork F1.1, reading A).
`a Jersey NPO body corporate that has applied` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Harbour Friends"
    `standing on the register` IS `an applicant for registration`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `a body corporate that is an NPO established under the law of Jersey`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
    governors IS LIST `governor Anna`
    purposes IS EMPTY

`a foreign entity that has applied` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Lakeside Trust of Geneva"
    `standing on the register` IS `an applicant for registration`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `an entity substantially similar to one of the above, established under the law of another jurisdiction`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS FALSE
    governors IS LIST `governor Ben`
    purposes IS EMPTY

`a body of persons that is no entity` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "A group of friends"
    `standing on the register` IS `not on the register`
    `kinds of entity` IS EMPTY
    `is a Jersey entity` IS FALSE
    governors IS EMPTY
    purposes IS EMPTY

`a Jersey company with one governor` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Solo Limited"
    `standing on the register` IS `an applicant for registration`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `a company`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
    governors IS LIST `governor Anna`
    purposes IS EMPTY

`a Jersey company with no governor` MEANS Entity WITH
    name IS "Empty Limited"
    `standing on the register` IS `an applicant for registration`
    `kinds of entity` IS LIST `a company`
    `is a Jersey entity` IS TRUE
    governors IS EMPTY
    purposes IS EMPTY

§§ `The application`

-- Dates (Article 11(2); Article 19(6) for the day it becomes complete).
`dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026` MEANS `Dates of an application` OF (YMD 2026 3 15), JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)
`dates: lodged on 1 March 2026, complete on 20 March 2026` MEANS `Dates of an application` OF (YMD 2026 3 1), JUST (YMD 2026 3 20)
`dates: lodged on 1 March 2026, not yet complete` MEANS `Dates of an application` OF (YMD 2026 3 1), NOTHING
`dates: lodged and complete on 29 February 2028` MEANS `Dates of an application` OF (YMD 2028 2 29), JUST (YMD 2028 2 29)

-- Article 11(2)(a): information on one matter.
`information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`information: not provided` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`information: provided, the position would differ, no proposal` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`information: provided, the position would differ, the proposal provided` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`information: not provided, but a proposal is` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE

`particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, FALSE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (i) not provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: not provided`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, FALSE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (i) differs once registered, no proposal` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided, the position would differ, no proposal`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, FALSE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (i) differs once registered, proposal provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided, the position would differ, the proposal provided`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, FALSE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (ii) not provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, `information: not provided`, FALSE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (iii) applies and is provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, TRUE, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`
`particulars: (iii) applies and is not provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, TRUE, `information: not provided`
`particulars: (iii) does not apply and is not provided` MEANS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` OF `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, `information: provided as at the application, the position unchanged`, FALSE, `information: not provided`

`documents: all provided` MEANS `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`documents: no copy of the constitution` MEANS `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`documents: no draft statement of purposes` MEANS `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`documents: no draft public benefit statement` MEANS `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE

-- Payments to governors (Article 11(2)(e)(ii)): the date, and whether the payee was a governor when paid and is one on the date of the application.
`payment of 100 to Anna on 14 March 2025` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2025 3 14), 100, TRUE, TRUE
`payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2025 3 15), 200, TRUE, TRUE
`payment of 300 to Anna on 1 March 2026` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2026 3 1), 300, TRUE, TRUE
`payment of 400 to Anna on 15 March 2026` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2026 3 15), 400, TRUE, TRUE
`payment of 500 to Anna on 10 March 2026` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2026 3 10), 500, TRUE, TRUE
-- the same payment as an application discloses its details: who, when and how much, without the facts about the payee that fork F4.11 reads
`payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025, as disclosed` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2025 3 15), 200, FALSE, FALSE
-- the same payee and date with a different amount
`payment of 999 to Anna on 15 March 2025, as disclosed` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Anna", (YMD 2025 3 15), 999, TRUE, TRUE
-- a person who was a governor when paid and has since stopped being one (fork F4.11)
`payment of 600 to Carl on 1 December 2025, who has since ceased to be a governor` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Carl", (YMD 2025 12 1), 600, TRUE, FALSE
-- a person who became a governor after being paid (fork F4.11)
`payment of 700 to Dina on 1 December 2025, who became a governor later` MEANS `Payment to a governor` OF "Dina", (YMD 2025 12 1), 700, FALSE, TRUE

`financial details: nothing further required` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: accounts exist and are not given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF TRUE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: accounts exist and are given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF TRUE, TRUE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: no accounts exist and none are given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a draft statement under the Order is given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: the Non-Profit Organizations Law requires more and it is not given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: the Non-Profit Organizations Law requires more and it is given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: an Order prescribes more, the general section is requested, it is not given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`financial details: an Order prescribes more, the restricted section is requested, it is not given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`financial details: no Order prescribes more, the general section is requested, none is given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: an Order prescribes more, the general section is requested, it is given` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, EMPTY, EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE

`financial details: a payment on 15 March 2025 made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 15 March 2025 made and disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025`), (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025`), FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 15 March 2025 made and its details disclosed without the facts about the payee` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025`), (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025, as disclosed`), FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 15 March 2025 made and disclosed with a different amount` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 200 to Anna on 15 March 2025`), (LIST `payment of 999 to Anna on 15 March 2025, as disclosed`), FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 14 March 2025 made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 100 to Anna on 14 March 2025`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 15 March 2026 made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 400 to Anna on 15 March 2026`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 1 March 2026 made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 300 to Anna on 1 March 2026`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment on 10 March 2026 made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 500 to Anna on 10 March 2026`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment to a former governor made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 600 to Carl on 1 December 2025, who has since ceased to be a governor`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: a payment to a later governor made and not disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 700 to Dina on 1 December 2025, who became a governor later`), EMPTY, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`financial details: two payments made, only the one in the period disclosed` MEANS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` OF FALSE, FALSE, (LIST `payment of 100 to Anna on 14 March 2025`, `payment of 300 to Anna on 1 March 2026`), (LIST `payment of 300 to Anna on 1 March 2026`), FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

`other requirements: none arise` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`other requirements: Regulations require more and it is not given` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`other requirements: Regulations require more and it is given` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`other requirements: the Commissioner has asked for more and it is not given` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`other requirements: the Commissioner has asked for more and it is given` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`other requirements: the procedure under the Regulations was not followed` MEANS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- The application in which everything is provided and nothing conditional arises: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026.
`the base application` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

-- The same application with ONE piece replaced (the language has no record update).
GIVEN `the dates` IS A `Dates of an application`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with dates` `the dates` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `the dates`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the particulars` IS A `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with particulars` `the particulars` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `the particulars`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the documents` IS A `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with documents` `the documents` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `the documents`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the financial details` IS A `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with financial details` `the financial details` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `the financial details`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the other requirements` IS A `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with other requirements` `the other requirements` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `the other requirements`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

GIVEN `the provisions disapplied` IS LIST OF `Item of Article 11(2)`
GIVETH AN `Application for registration`
`the base application with provisions disapplied` `the provisions disapplied` MEANS `Application for registration` WITH
    `dates` IS `dates: lodged and complete on 15 March 2026`
    `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `particulars: everything provided, paragraph (iii) does not apply`
    `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `documents: all provided`
    `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `financial details: nothing further required`
    `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `other requirements: none arise`
    `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS `the provisions disapplied`

§§ `The findings`

-- The Commissioner's findings in the case where nothing stands in the way: the constitution is written, the applicant is a Jersey entity (so no activity is needed), no prescribed ground applies.
`the base findings` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS FALSE
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS TRUE
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS FALSE
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS FALSE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS FALSE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS FALSE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS FALSE

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on meeting the charity test on registration as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS `the new value`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on a written constitution as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS `the new value`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on an activity in or from within Jersey as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS `the new value`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the opinion on a substantial activity as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS `the new value`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on a mandatory prescribed ground as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS `the new value`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on a discretionary prescribed ground whose circumstances are present as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS `the new value`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied`

GIVEN findings IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
findings `but with the finding on a discretionary prescribed ground as` `the new value` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS findings's `applicant will meet the charity test on registration`
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS findings's `constitution of the applicant is a written document`
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS findings's `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey`
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS findings's `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS findings's `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present`
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS `the new value`

-- The findings for a foreign entity with a substantial activity in Jersey (Article 11(4)(c)(ii)).
`the findings for a foreign entity with a substantial activity in Jersey` MEANS `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
    `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS FALSE
    `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS TRUE
    `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS TRUE
    `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS TRUE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS FALSE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS FALSE
    `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS FALSE

§§ `The case of Article 11(4)`

-- Everything the decision of Article 11(4) reads, in one record, so that a test names a case and not eleven arguments. The standard inputs keep their meaning: see the @desc of each parameter in g4-art11-decision.l4.
DECLARE `Case under Article 11(4)` HAS
    `reading` IS A `Interpretation of Articles 11 and 12`
    `application` IS A `Application for registration`
    `an Order under Article 13(9) applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `Article 19(5) complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
    `applicant` IS A `Entity`
    `meets the charity test` IS A BOOLEAN
    `findings` IS A `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)`
    `principal address in Jersey` IS A BOOLEAN
    `name undesirable` IS A BOOLEAN
    `Article 19(9)(c) bar` IS A BOOLEAN
    `court order not to register` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The case in which the applicant complies, the six matters are found and no bar applies: the Commissioner must register.
`the base case` MEANS `Case under Article 11(4)` WITH
    `reading` IS `the default reading`
    `application` IS `the base application`
    `an Order under Article 13(9) applies` IS FALSE
    `Article 19(5) complied with` IS TRUE
    `applicant` IS `a Jersey company that has applied`
    `meets the charity test` IS TRUE
    `findings` IS `the base findings`
    `principal address in Jersey` IS TRUE
    `name undesirable` IS FALSE
    `Article 19(9)(c) bar` IS FALSE
    `court order not to register` IS FALSE

GIVEN case IS A `Case under Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A `Interpretation of Articles 11 and 12`
GIVETH A `Case under Article 11(4)`
case `but with the reading as` `the new value` MEANS `Case under Article 11(4)` WITH
    `reading` IS `the new value`
    `application` IS case's `application`
    `an Order under Article 13(9) applies` IS case's `an Order under Article 13(9) applies`
    `Article 19(5) complied with` IS case's `Article 19(5) complied with`
    `applicant` IS case's `applicant`
    `meets the charity test` IS case's `meets the charity test`
    `findings` IS case's `findings`
    `principal address in Jersey` IS case's `principal address in Jersey`
    `name undesirable` IS case's `name undesirable`
    `Article 19(9)(c) bar` IS case's `Article 19(9)(c) bar`
    `court order not to register` IS case's `court order not to register`

GIVEN case IS A `Case under Article 11(4)`
      `the new value` IS A `Application for registration`
GIVETH A `Case under Article 11(4)`
case `but with the application as` `the new value` MEANS `Case under Article 11(4)` WITH
    `reading` IS case's `reading`
